  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "急需数据报告与暗藏的心事  (An Urgent Data Report and Hidden Heartache)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "ji_xiu": "吉秀"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Continuing their heart-to-heart in the office, Bu Xiaogu tells Ji Xiu why spotting Chun Yuqiao happily drinking tea with Wen Simo convinced her he does not share her feelings. Listen to their Mandarin exchange first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没想到淳于总他会这么排斥我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我已经做好一切准备了，接受他对我的任何反应。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你可能想得太严重，他可能是因为离职心情不好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是今天我看见他跟闻思默老师一块儿喝茶，他看起来很高兴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "重要的是，他其实根本就不是真的喜欢我，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "苦情报告结束，咱们谈生意吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你让我做的这个数据报告我们可以做，但要看下多大功夫。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "只要能帮到荣思伦，您开多少价都行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "就这个价，不还价，因为你们要得急，我现在就开工。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "结果出来了，荣思伦果然是全网的不二人选。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了，我也特别希望他能演倾城公主。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "成长是需要付出代价的，你可能还需要一些勇气。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没想到淳于总他会这么排斥我。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I never expected Mr Chun Yuqiao to shut me out like this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我已经做好一切准备了，接受他对我的任何反应。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I had already prepared myself to accept whatever reaction he might have toward me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你可能想得太严重，他可能是因为离职心情不好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You may be overthinking it; perhaps he is simply in a bad mood after resigning.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "可是今天我看见他跟闻思默老师一块儿喝茶，他看起来很高兴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet today I saw him having tea with Mr Wen Simo, and he looked genuinely happy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "重要的是，他其实根本就不是真的喜欢我，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What matters is that he never truly liked me at all, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "苦情报告结束，咱们谈生意吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Enough heartbreak reporting—let us talk business.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "你让我做的这个数据报告我们可以做，但要看下多大功夫。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We can produce the data report you asked for, though it depends on how much effort goes in.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "只要能帮到荣思伦，您开多少价都行。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As long as it helps Rong Silun, name whatever price you want.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "就这个价，不还价，因为你们要得急，我现在就开工。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This is the price, no haggling; since you need it urgently, I will get started right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "结果出来了，荣思伦果然是全网的不二人选。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The results are in, and Rong Silun really is the undisputed first choice across the internet.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了，我也特别希望他能演倾城公主。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wonderful, I really hope he gets to star in Princess Qingcheng too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "成长是需要付出代价的，你可能还需要一些勇气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Growing up comes at a price, and you may still need a bit more courage.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我没想到淳于总他会这么排斥我。",
      "gap": 0.5
