    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "太好了，我也特别希望他能演倾城公主。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "成长是需要付出代价的，你可能还需要一些勇气。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Setting heartache aside for business, Xiaogu accepts Ji Xiu's non-negotiable rush price on the spot, and Fentuan's data confirms the actor is the internet's top choice. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ji_xiu",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
